{
  "about": "Project paths below map/ and the archive names they pack to. Read by the TypeScript side (app/src/lib/formats/archivepath.test.ts) and the Rust side (crates/w3proj/src/paths.rs), so both map names the same way. roundTrip: both directions; toArchive: project path to archive name only (an escape the unpacker never writes).",
